\nNotice that in the equations $x=\\pm \\operatorname{arccos}⁡c+2\\pi n$ do not depend on $y.$ So, for a given $c\\in [-1,1]$ and integer $n$, the right-hand side of the equation is constant. As a result, we obtain a family of vertical lines, as shown below.\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\n![](images/c5/c5ea7e325483eeb3572c90b78a5cf72040d84b98dee51a1ca2bdf4dcab5b8d2f.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393142 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393143 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393144 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393145 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393146 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186393144 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393141 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "077949f5-62c8-59b7-9b63-c9e8b3537b15" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393142 #edb/ref 1080 "images/98/98d449048718ab75fc54a659bc74314f26b6059c5e7a7ed4af28b7edfeb69a69.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393142 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393142 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bdd6b5d4-ea23-5caf-8777-7138860af8ce" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393143 #edb/ref 1080 "images/a8/a8c4e910e3884ee68518752ab814f491edb14d422b4c25926b7d3ad34720592d.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393143 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393143 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7487cd45-f801-550a-a1b4-5e2864c83b4b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393144 #edb/ref 1080 "images/c5/c5ea7e325483eeb3572c90b78a5cf72040d84b98dee51a1ca2bdf4dcab5b8d2f.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393144 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186393144 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2bc74059-a769-